Project Objective

The objective of this project is to demonstrate how raw financial and loan data can be transformed into an interactive credit-risk analytics solution.

The analysis focuses on understanding:

Who is taking loans, what types of loans are being taken, how the portfolio is distributed, and what financial characteristics are associated with different loan outcomes.
